# Cloudflare Pages (GitHub Pages ignora este arquivo)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
